  "categorias": "Fiestas|Noticias",
  "post_content": "<p>Rub&eacute;n Lucas Garc&iacute;a, de M&uacute;rcia, &eacute;s l&#39;autor del cartell guanyador per a Fira d&#39;Onda 2017, que porta per lema &#39;Alegria&#39;, elegit pel jurat entre els 8 treballs presentats. Es poden veure a la sala d&#39;exposicions de la Casa de Cultura fins diumenge 10 de setembre.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/09/IMG_6066.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>El premi &eacute;s de 600 euros i l&#39;obra ser&agrave; la portada del programa de festes, que seran del 7 al 29 d&#39;octubre.</p>\n<p>A l&#39;acte d&#39;inauguraci&oacute; de las mosta i anunci del veredicte han assistit una bona part de la corporaci&oacute; municipal, encap&ccedil;alada per l&#39;alcalde, Ximo Huguet Lecha, a m&eacute;s de la reina de la Fira d&#39;Onda 2017, Mireia Centelles Navarro, i les seues dos dames d&#39;honor, aix&iacute; com la reina infantil, Roc&iacute;o Vilar Navarro, amb la seua cort d&#39;honor.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cartellfira17/img_6027.jpg\" alt=\"img_6027\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cartellfira17/img_6029.jpg\" alt=\"img_6029\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cartellfira17/img_6032.jpg\" alt=\"img_6032\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cartellfira17/img_6033.jpg\" alt=\"img_6033\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cartellfira17/img_6038.jpg\" alt=\"img_6038\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cartellfira17/img_6039.jpg\" alt=\"img_6039\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cartellfira17/img_6040.jpg\" alt=\"img_6040\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cartellfira17/img_6041.jpg\" alt=\"img_6041\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cartellfira17/img_6045.jpg\" alt=\"img_6045\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cartellfira17/img_6046.jpg\" alt=\"img_6046\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cartellfira17/img_6047.jpg\" alt=\"img_6047\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cartellfira17/img_6050.jpg\" alt=\"img_6050\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cartellfira17/img_6052.jpg\" alt=\"img_6052\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cartellfira17/img_6053.jpg\" alt=\"img_6053\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cartellfira17/img_6055.jpg\" alt=\"img_6055\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cartellfira17/img_6059.jpg\" alt=\"img_6059\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cartellfira17/img_6060.jpg\" alt=\"img_6060\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cartellfira17/img_6062.jpg\" alt=\"img_6062\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cartellfira17/img_6065.jpg\" alt=\"img_6065\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev